  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Tuesday Night Squad** (1 review): Tuesday Night Squad is split in the track list, with an unidentified piece between its two parts [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **tmp**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Soulive2012-11-10.AKG468.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 11 songs; 87 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **Soulive2012-11-10**: source not stated; 2 songs; 87 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Shady Horns joined the band on stage: Ryan Zoidis, Rashawn Ross and James Casey [2]\n- The set was billed as 'A Royal Family Affair' on the Purple Hat Stage [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Soulive2012-11-10.AKG468.flac16**: taped by Scott Douglas; source: AKG c460b/ck8 (PAS) > Oade T+ Mod Edirol UA-5 > iRiver iHP-120 (16Bit/48KHz) [1]. Also: The recording is labeled AKG468 and distributed as 16-bit FLAC [3]\n- **Soulive2012-11-10**: Recorded with Neumann SKM-140 mics into an Edirol R-44 at 24-bit/48k, then converted to 16/44 WAV and FLAC using CD Wave Editor [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Live Music Blog: [VIDEO ROUNDUP: Bear Creek Music & Art Festival 2012 - Live Music Blog](https://livemusicblog.com/video-roundup-bear-creek-music-art-festival-2012/) [5]",
